<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italian BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italian BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a seventh tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 7.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   November 1, 2006    previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.36 pct vs	6.32 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.34 pct vs	7.29 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  103.70   vs    104.05</p>
<p> Bids		 2.318 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   1.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The previous auction was of a fifth tranche of the 10-year, 7.75 percent BTP on November 28.</p>
</text>
